{"abstract":"Evidence shows that software development methods, frameworks, and even practices are seldom applied in companies by following the book. Combinations of different methodologies into home-grown processes are being constantly uncovered. Nonetheless, an academic understanding and investigation of this phenomenon is very limited. In 2016, the HELENA initiative was launched to research hybrid development approaches in software system development. This paper introduces the 3rd HELENA workshop and provides a detailed description of the instrument used and the available data sets.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Tell, Paolo","MacDonell, Stephen","Licorish, Sherlock A."],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382798"],"event":{"acronym":"PROFES","title":"International Conference on Product-Focused Software Process Improvement"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["OECD","Oceania"],"country":["New Zealand"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Auckland University of Technology","University of Otago"],"keyword":["HELENA Initiative","Home Grown Processes","Hybrid Development Approaches","Software Development Methods","Software System Development"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"000000000003rd workshop on hybrid development approaches in software system development","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83523895/3rdWsIntro_preprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382798","identifier":[{"id":"85057254574","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-662963b0-45e6-4b86-9b2e-7b3bb81ae007"],"keyword":["HELENA Initiative","Home-Grown Processes","Hybrid Development Approaches","Software Development Methods","Software System Development"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-D60380634B2D15E63A390007DAD42107"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/83523895/3rdWsIntro_preprint.pdf","version":"Authors Final Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Realised","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2018","yearSub":"2018"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Software Engineering, Software Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"nz","key":"auckland university of technology","loc":["New Zealand","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"Auckland University of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"nz","key":"university of otago","loc":["New Zealand","Oceania","OECD"],"name":"University of Otago","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Paolo","key":"tellpau","last":"Tell","locid":"2b8ff3a4-e9b0-403d-8bd8-1bf26121c234","name":"Tell, Paolo","orcid":"0000-0001-7391-0046","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Stephen","key":"macdonellpau","last":"MacDonell","name":"MacDonell, Stephen","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Sherlock A.","key":"licorishpau","last":"Licorish","name":"Licorish, Sherlock A.","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-030-03673-7_34","isbn":["9783030036720"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"433-440","publisher":"Springer","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","title":"International Conference on Product-Focused Software Process Improvement - PROFES 2018"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85057254574"],"sear